@startuml
title Figure 11: Base Scenario - Completion of the resource order (item) related to the SIM card product

participant "Product Order\nDelivery & Orchestration\nManagement" as PODOM
participant "Event Management" as Event #grey

box "Logistic Partner"
  participant "Supply Chain\nManagement" as SCM #blue
end box

box "Internal Supply Chain"
  participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
  participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
  participant "Resource Catalog\nManagement" as RCM #blue
end box

== Step 1 (SIM Card) ==

ROM -> RCM : 1 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification
activate RCM
RCM --> ROM : 2 **TMF634** 200 OK (resourceSpecChar)
deactivate RCM

ROM -> ROM : 3 **TMF685 Resource Pool Management**\nPOST /resourcePoolManagement/AvailabilityCheck\n(resourcePool=SIM Card)
ROM --> ROM : 4 **TMF685** 201 Created (available resources)
ROM -> ROM : 5 select SIM Card resource

ROM -> RI : 6 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 7 **TMF639** 200 OK (SIM Card)

ROM -> RI : 8 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource\n(SIM card, resourceStatus="reserved")
RI --> ROM : 9 **TMF639** 204 No Contect
deactivate RI

ROM -> ROM : 10 update resourceOrderItem (SIM card attributes)

ROM -> Event : 11 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderAttributeValueChange\n(SIM card)
activate Event
Event -> PODOM : 12 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderAttributeValueChange\n(SIM card)
deactivate Event

group variant 1 only

    ROM -> SCM : 13 //**TMF700 Shipping Order Management**//\n//POST /shippingOrder//\n//(SIM card)//
    activate SCM
    SCM --> ROM : 14 //**TMF700** 201 Created (shippingOrder)//

    note over SCM, ROM
      Actual shipment process is not shown.
      UC004 has some details.
    end note

    SCM -> Event : 15 //**TMF688 Event Management**//\n//POST event shippingOrderStateChange//
    activate Event
    Event -> ROM : 16 //**TMF688 Event Management**//\n//POST listener/shippingOrderStateChange//
    deactivate Event
    deactivate SCM

end

ROM -> RI : 17 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource\n(SIM card, resourceStatus="standby")
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 18 **TMF639** 204 No Content
deactivate RI

ROM -> ROM : 19 update resourceOrderItem (state="completed")

note over ROM : continued in\nfigure 10

@enduml
